<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_860_2401.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig dienst, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear> was wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegent</unclear>, zuovor. Fromm fürsichtig
<lb n="3"/>ersam, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innsonders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> fründ, unnd
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Eydtgnossen</orgName>. Unns
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanngt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanndtmaeß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear>, das herr <persName resp="#ner">Bischoff
<lb n="6"/>von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Costennz</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">amptlüth</unclear>, umb <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Costennz</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umb</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/>har <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemaandt</unclear>, das sy inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">knecht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annemen</unclear>.
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darzuo</unclear>, das <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Hanibal von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Embs</unclear></persName>, ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obrister</unclear> über
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">regiment</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lanzknechten</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nam</unclear>-
<lb n="10"/>lich ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">musterplaz</unclear>, by <placeName resp="#ner">Wingarten</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear>, ouch ein
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschrey</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußgon</unclear>, das man söllicher <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">knecht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gen</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-341" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Nea</unclear>-
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">polis</unclear></placeName>, alda dem <persName resp="#ner">Bapst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vom</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Türcken</unclear></persName>, etwas schadens
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschechen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölle</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fueren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welle</unclear> etc. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Diewyl</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daßselbig</unclear> noch nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwüß</unclear>, unnd doch sovil <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selt</unclear>-
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zamerr</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">löuffenn</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschrey</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorhannden</unclear>, das
<lb n="16"/>sich wol zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umbsechen</unclear>, unnd dann unns nit
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüssenn</unclear> ob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hievonn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ettwas</unclear> kund ist, unnd aber ir
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllichen</unclear> sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelegen</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonderlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">am</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">basten</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erkonndigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>, wohin doch diser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">knecht</unclear>, ge-
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuert</unclear>, und was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pratigken</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> werck <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllen</unclear>,
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habenn</unclear> wir üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unangezeigt</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>,
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gannz</unclear> fründtlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pittennde</unclear>, ir wellen hierumb,
<lb n="23"/>(als wir nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwyfflen</unclear> ir für üch selbs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> syen)
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vlyßige</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">spech</unclear> unnd erkundigung machen,
<lb n="25"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">volgends</unclear> unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">des</unclear>, so ir deßhalben erfaren
<lb n="26"/>werden, unnd unns zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear> von nöten, ufs
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürderlichest</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinwiderumb</unclear> wir
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erpietens</unclear>, so unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderswo</unclear> har, etwas
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwüsses</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diser</unclear>, oder ander <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derglychen</unclear> sachen halb,
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuokeme</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> deß ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">teilhafftig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zemachen</unclear>, da-
<lb n="31"/>mit, so etwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">boeser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">praticken</unclear> angeschlagen,
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieselbigen</unclear> etlicher <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gstalt</unclear>, mit hilff und
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_860_2402.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="33"/>gnad, des allmechtigen Gottes <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">destbas</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verhindert</unclear>
<lb n="34"/>werden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>. Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstonnd</unclear> von
<lb n="35"/>uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">meynung</unclear>, als es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschicht</unclear>.
<lb n="36"/>Unnd sind hiemit Gott <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevolchen</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="37"/><origDate when="1564-05-20" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sambstags den 20 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maij</unclear>, Anno etc. 64</origDate>.
<lb n="38"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rath
<lb n="39"/>der Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuerich</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_860_2403.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_860_2404.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="40"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear> ersamen
<lb n="41"/>unnd wysen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister
<lb n="42"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rat</unclear>, der Statt Sannt Gallen</orgName>
<lb n="43"/>unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innßunders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frunden</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getruwen</unclear> lieben
<lb n="45"/>Eydtgnossen.
</p>
